<Vertical id="hs2_film_obs_list_q">
<Markdown><![CDATA[
**Elements we all said we saw:**

- a ship exposed to powerful storms and waves
- ropes and anchors becoming strained or weakened
- rust and gradual deterioration of the ship
- water entering the ship
- damage building gradually rather than happening all at once
]]></Markdown>
