  <Key value="Housing instability can develop as multiple pressures interact, supports weaken, and problems accumulate over time.">Housing instability can develop as multiple pressures interact, supports weaken, and problems accumulate over time.</Key>
  <Distractor value="Housing instability usually results from one major event that suddenly overwhelms a household.">Housing instability usually results from one major event that suddenly overwhelms a household.</Distractor>
  <Distractor value="Housing instability occurs mainly when people lack the ability to respond effectively to unexpected problems.">Housing instability occurs mainly when people lack the ability to respond effectively to unexpected problems.</Distractor>
  <Distractor value="Housing instability develops independently of the larger economic, social, and environmental conditions surrounding people.">Housing instability develops independently of the larger economic, social, and environmental conditions surrounding people.</Distractor>
</ChoiceInput>
